Package: showkitr
Title: Before/After Showcase Cards for Function Calls
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("David", "Brocker", email = "davidabrocker@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs a function call, captures its before/after state, and
    composites a styled before/after image for sharing (e.g. "function of
    the day" posts). Includes an RStudio Addin that wraps a selected call
    with fx_showcase() in place. Auto-detects the source package of the
    called function to fill in title/subtitle/logo from its documentation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    fs,
    ggplot2,
    gt,
    magick,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
